            0.248
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(a) Why is the tungsten used almost exclusively for filament of electric lamps?",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 5,
